al homies that  are far more powerful than the rest  these homies include Zeus the  thundercloud that is summoned by her  left hand Prometheus the Sun that is  summoned by her right hand  and Napoleon who takes the form of big  mobs hat the Sun can create flames the  cloud can create lightning bolts and  together they can manipulate the weather  her hat can turn into a blade that she  can wield or that can move and attack by  itself her hat can also relay  information to her that it receives from  other homies Zeus the cloud can be read  and on and it allows big mom to travel  at high speeds prometheus can also  engulf the Polian in flames increasing  the power of the sword furthermore the  sword can release powerful destructive  shockwaves in short big mom and her  powers are definitely larger than life  big mom can also use all three haki  types conquers haki armament haki and  observation haki her armament haki can  easily withstand a punch from luffy's  powerful fourth gear  aka gear for now let's get to red haired  shanks finally he's definitely one of my  favorite characters and I love the way  Oda has constructed him red haired  shanks is currently 39 years old in the  manga and he was 27 years old in chapter  1 he used to be a member of the Roger  pirates when he was younger serving  under the pirate king himself what  fascinates me the most about shanks is  how Oda is able to build so much hype  around him without revealing too much  about his powers we didn't see anything  crazy from his 27 year old self although  we didn't know what it was back then we  did see him use conquerors haki to scare  off the seeking after it took his arm  off later when we see him approaching  white beard his hockey power is enough  to make many of white beard skilled  pirates pass out when white beard and  shanks clash just as when Kaito and big  mom clash they split the heavens  suggesting their otherworldly level of  power I know he was only 27 at the time  and was not as strong as he is now but  still I loved how such a strong dude  chose not to absolutely wreck and it  after he spilled a drink in his face  here we have a guy who must be one of  the strongest pirates in the world even  at the age of 27 and he led a random  bandit make him look like a weakling as  Luffy put it even at 27 he had nothing  to prove to anyone he had no ego about  the situation he understood that  needless killing doesn't make you a man  just because that guy threw a drink in  shanks his face it doesn't mean  he actually heard shanks in anyway  shanks understood that one can only be  offended if they choose to be offended  and he was above all that at the young  age of twenty seven truly an amazing  character and role model even as a 39  year old shanks is the youngest  yong-chol and i think i probably speak  for most of us when i say that shanks  showing up in putting a stop to the war  at marine fort was one of the most epic  and amazing moments in anime albeit a  lot of people were injured but it's  amazing how none of the Marines or even  Blackbeard dare to challenge shanks if  that doesn't set him up as being  extremely powerful I don't know what  does it's noteworthy that shanks even as  a young Co could get an audience with  the five elders who are the public heads  of the celestial dragons and world  government that is how much sway shanks  holds we also saw that near the end of  the battle at marine Ford he was able to  effortlessly stop a kindness punch with  his sword and haki we know that he was  able to prevent fellow young Hokkaido  from attacking white beard before he  lost his arm shanks dueled mihawk the  strongest swordsman in the world and  survived  what's more Kaito has a devil fruit big  mob has a devil fruit Blackbeard has two  devil fruits but shanks doesn't possess  any devil fruit powers this just makes  all of his accomplishments and his  reputation seem all the more impressive  so that is what we know about shanks not  only can he use all three types of haki  he arguably has the most powerful haki  we've never seen him go all out but that  just builds all the more hype around his  character anyways that is it for today's  video thanks so much for watching  obviously there is much more to be said  about all of these characters so if you  want to see me go into detail on one  specifically let me know in the comments  and smash that like button because I'll  start working on the next one peace  video as soon as we reach 5,000 likes if  you haven't be sure to subscribe and  this is crucial ring that notification  bow so you don't miss future videos for  daily anime content and to help decide  what videos I make in the future boss on  instagram at anime uproar a special  thank you goes to our patrons over on  patreon who help us survive YouTube  issues and who helped make videos like  this one possible first and foremost I  want to thank our the one tier patrons  the ones who stay on top all clans  Steven and Greta allo Lana  and the world Steelers the school bus  and Tyson Kirino and I can't forget our  pro hero to your patrons the one and  only Gilgamesh nothing but a fan Jason  Wilson Kings eldress $30 beat Anatole  Cassatt Suki alpha do angel Cruz team  sparty 65 cricket XP Rohan Kapoor just  come alone the Emperor Taku Timothy  Edward Vargas Jeanne d'Arc Joel Stanton  and jccc Wacha thank you all so much if  you enjoy our work you can support more  of it by going over to patreon  accomplish anime uproar and becoming a  patron today for as little as $1 if you  do so you'll get your name featured in  future videos alongside these amazing  people right here and you'll even get  access to our private patron only  discord where we talk about anime life  and of course dank memes so check out  patreon accomplished and may uproar link  in the description if you're interested  you can also now join the YouTube  channel and support more content that  way if you prefer whichever way you  choose to support us you will get the  same great benefits thanks for  everything and until next time see us  space cowboy  [Music]
 

